    given-names: Fabio
    affiliation: "Kampakis and Co Ltd (The Tesseract Academy)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/fabio-rovai/learning-standards-ontology"
abstract: >-
  An OWL 2 ontology, SKOS identifier-scheme registry and SHACL governance layer for K-12 academic
  standards, together with a census of identifier resolvability across the public standards corpus
  and a measurement of what the incumbent standards can and cannot reject.
keywords:
  - ontology
  - SHACL
  - education
  - learning standards
  - K-12
  - register assurance
  - identifier governance
